# Guard, not a build configuration.
#
# The deployable app is the Next.js radar in web/. Set the Vercel project's
# Root Directory to `web`, Framework to Next.js, and leave Output Directory
# empty. See web/README.md.
#
# Keeping the engine out of the upload means FastAPI auto-detect cannot fire
# even if Root Directory is lost. The engine belongs on the CPU VPS.

spy_der/
scripts/
tests/
deploy/
docs/
pyproject.toml
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*
*.db
.github/
